abstract: >-
  Complete deterministic verification suite (12 experiments, 10 Python scripts,
  9 raw JSON archives, 12 publication-grade figures, and Google Colab GPU notebook)
  accompanying three original research articles on Quantum Overfitting Amplification
  and Q-DSR_nu, the Contextuality-Signaling Dichotomy in Autoregressive LLMs, and
  Minimax Post-Selection Auditing (SIPS_infinity) with Welch-Superposition Membership
  Inference Duality.
